WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.089 --> 00:00:17.681
Do you love bike riding?

2
00:00:18.682 --> 00:00:19.123
I do.

3
00:00:20.003 --> 00:00:22.005
I ride my bike every day.

4
00:00:23.306 --> 00:00:25.508
It's important to take care of your bike.

5
00:00:27.069 --> 00:00:27.990
I'll show you how!

6
00:00:30.124 --> 00:00:32.405
First, always check your bike's tires.

7
00:00:33.565 --> 00:00:35.866
You don't want to get a flat tire!

8
00:00:47.289 --> 00:00:50.010
So make sure your tires have enough air.

9
00:00:56.031 --> 00:00:58.252
This will protect the wheels too.

10
00:01:00.536 --> 00:01:03.538
Second, oil the chain sometimes.

11
00:01:04.658 --> 00:01:07.480
This helps your chain last a long time.

12
00:01:09.261 --> 00:01:10.541
Get some bicycle oil.

13
00:01:12.783 --> 00:01:14.824
Turn one pedal with your hand.

14
00:01:16.425 --> 00:01:19.626
At the same time, drop oil on the chain.

15
00:01:24.449 --> 00:01:26.370
All you need is a few drops!

16
00:01:29.792 --> 00:01:32.188
Third, keep your bike dry.

17
00:01:35.889 --> 00:01:38.430
Rain will make the metal parts rust.

18
00:01:44.272 --> 00:01:45.952
Keep your bike inside.

19
00:01:48.773 --> 00:01:52.454
If you must store it outside, get a cover for it.

20
00:01:55.855 --> 00:01:58.976
Sometimes your bike will get wet or muddy.

21
00:01:59.956 --> 00:02:02.138
Just wipe it as soon as you can.

22
00:02:08.924 --> 00:02:12.447
Fourth, take your bike to a shop once a year.

23
00:02:13.528 --> 00:02:15.510
An expert can check your bike.

24
00:02:16.511 --> 00:02:18.753
Then you will know it's safe to ride.

25
00:02:20.875 --> 00:02:22.376
It's like seeing the doctor!

26
00:02:22.396 --> 00:02:26.720
Oh, there's one more thing.

27
00:02:28.348 --> 00:02:30.610
Check your seat height before you ride.

28
00:02:32.032 --> 00:02:32.932
Sit on the seat.

29
00:02:33.793 --> 00:02:35.695
Your feet should touch the ground.

30
00:02:38.397 --> 00:02:41.440
As you grow, you will need to raise the seat.

31
00:02:43.882 --> 00:02:45.984
I already raised mine twice!

32
00:02:48.446 --> 00:02:49.848
My bike looks great.

33
00:02:53.131 --> 00:02:54.472
I'm ready to ride now.

34
00:02:56.864 --> 00:02:59.167
There's a new bike path in the park.

35
00:03:00.969 --> 00:03:02.752
I can't wait to try it!
